  - "rsi_mean_reversion (run_014): corr = -0.0223"
  - "keltner_breakout (run_015, 033): corr = -0.1705 (signal inversion)"
  - "keltner_mean_reversion (run_017, 024, 027, 033): corr = 0.2145 on regime-gated bars only (~1%); ic_active_bars = -0.032 (p=0.83, not significant). Per KB reattribution, root cause is signal_quality, not regime_availability."
